/* The waiting-on ledger: open loops with a person on the other end, ranked by how long
   they have been open. Age is the one dimension these rows share, so it is the one thing
   the column sorts by and the one thing allowed a colour: two weeks of silence is a loop
   that has demonstrably failed, not merely an old row. */
.ledger{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(23rem,1fr));gap:1rem;
  align-items:start}
