/* A commitment closed on evidence: the row is gone because the promise was shown to have
   been kept, which is a derivation and not an acknowledgement -- so it leaves no ✕ and no
   store behind. The evidence is still printed, because a reminder that vanishes silently
   is indistinguishable from a reminder the tool dropped. */
